      "example_text": "Input: s = \"010101\", k = 1, queries = [[0,5],[1,4],[2,3]]\nOutput: [15,9,3]\nExplanation:\nThe substrings of s with a length greater than 3 do not satisfy the k-constraint.",
      "images": []
    }
  ],
  "constraints": [
